# ---------------------------------------------------------------- what is airpaz affiliate
msgid "affiliate_intro.about.kicker"
msgstr "What is Airpaz Affiliate?"

msgid "affiliate_intro.about.title"
msgstr "A partnership that pays you for every traveler you send our way"

msgid "affiliate_intro.about.paragraph_1"
msgstr "Airpaz is an online travel agent that has helped travelers book flights, hotels, activities and ground transport since {year}. The Airpaz Affiliate Program lets you share that inventory with your own audience — on a blog, a social channel, a newsletter, a travel community or a business website."

msgid "affiliate_intro.about.paragraph_2"
msgstr "You get a personal tracking link and ready-made creative assets. Whenever someone clicks your link and completes a booking on Airpaz, the transaction is attributed to you and a {rate} commission is credited to your affiliate account. You can follow every click, booking and payout right here in your dashboard."

msgid "affiliate_intro.about.paragraph_3"
msgstr "There is nothing to build, stock or support. Airpaz handles search, payment, ticketing and customer service — you simply bring the travelers."

